The law
-------
The texts come from official sources only: the Bulletin Officiel published by the Secrétariat Général du
Gouvernement (sgg.gov.ma), the Ministry of Justice's portal Adala (adala.justice.gov.ma), the Direction Générale des
Impôts' yearly edition of the tax code (tax.gov.ma) and the Parliament's documents. Official texts carry no copyright
(law 2-00, article 8). Reuse cites the source and its date and never distorts the text (law 31-13, article 6). The
Bulletin prevails over any consolidated version.

