  The topics' yearly figures (back/apps/topics/*/series.yaml) are copied, each with its title, link, page and the
  hash of the file kept, from the publications of the Haut-Commissariat au Plan (hcp.ma), Bank Al-Maghrib (bkam.ma),
  the Agence Nationale de la Sécurité Routière (narsa.ma), the ministries and the national open data portal
  (data.gov.ma).

